    "Chiba University of Commerce\nChiba University\nof Commerce\nA higher educational institution of the 21st century,\nchallenging to create new wisdom, intellect\nand knowledge.\nChiba University\nof Commerce\nChiba University\nof Commerce\nChiba University\nof Commerce\nNews\nApril 3, 2024\nCUC published \"Chiba University of Commerce Integrated Report 2023\".\nTowards the First 100% Renewable Energy University in Japan\nTo contribute to the creation of a sustainable society, CUC is promoting the introduction of renewable energy and CUC students are carrying out energy conservation activities on campus.\nRead More\nAcademics\nFaculties\nFaculty of Commerce and Economics\nFaculty of Policy Informatics\nFaculty of Service Innovation\nFaculty of Humanities and Social Sciences\nFaculty of Global Studies\nGraduate School\nDoctoral Program\nMaster's Program\nMBA Program\nStudent Life\nTuition & Fees\nScholarships\nEmployment Results\nCampus Map\nPlaces to Visit\nInternational Dormitory\nReturn to Top"
